      +                          CON
 36697                           ;	PPSLOCK bit One-Way Set Enable bit
 36698                           ;	PPS1WAY = OFF, PPSLOCKED bit can be set and cleared repeatedly (subject to the unlock 
      +                          sequence)
 36699                           ;	Stack Full/Underflow Reset Enable bit
 36700                           ;	STVREN = ON, Stack full/underflow will cause Reset
